8. Traversing a List

Using for loop:

numbers = [10, 20, 30, 40]

for num in numbers:
    print(num)

Output:

10
20
30
40
9. Checking an Element
numbers = [10, 20, 30]

if 20 in numbers:
    print("Found")

Output:

Found
